        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    actor Reviewer as \&quot;Admin/Operator\&quot;\n    participant UI as \&quot;Interface: UI\&quot;\n    participant API as \&quot;mainController: Controller\&quot;\n    participant App as \&quot;applicationService: Service\&quot;\n    participant DB as \&quot;PostgreSQL: Database\&quot;\n    Reviewer-&gt;&gt;UI: Open PendingApproval order\n    UI-&gt;&gt;+API: GET /api/v1/orders/{id}\n    API-&gt;&gt;App: Read scoped order\n    App-&gt;&gt;DB: Load lines, snapshots and status history\n    DB--&gt;&gt;UI: Order details\n    Reviewer-&gt;&gt;UI: Approve or reject with reason\n    alt Approve before cutoff\n        UI-&gt;&gt;+API: POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/approve\n        API-&gt;&gt;App: Approve(order)\n        App-&gt;&gt;DB: Validate version and authority\n        App-&gt;&gt;DB: Set AwaitingAllocation and audit\n        API--&gt;&gt;-UI: Approved; no stock reserved\n    else Reject\n        UI-&gt;&gt;+API: POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/reject\n        API-&gt;&gt;App: Reject(order, reason)\n        App-&gt;&gt;DB: Set Rejected and notify Sales\n        API--&gt;&gt;-UI: Rejected\n    end\n\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="Ij1NHlAiKyZU21_ZeduC-1">
